{
  "$schema": "https://aokit.andryore.dev/schema/module/v1.json",
  "conflicts": [],
  "deps": {
    "dependencies": {
      "@trigger.dev/sdk": {
        "range": "catalog"
      }
    },
    "devDependencies": {
      "trigger.dev": {
        "range": "catalog"
      }
    }
  },
  "env": [
    {
      "example": "",
      "key": "TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY",
      "schema": "z.string().min(1)",
      "scope": "jobs"
    }
  ],
  "extensionPoints": [],
  "files": [
    {
      "from": "files/trigger.config.ts",
      "ownership": "managed",
      "target": "jobs",
      "to": "trigger.config.ts"
    },
    {
      "from": "files/src/trigger/hello-world.ts",
      "ownership": "seed",
      "target": "jobs",
      "to": "src/trigger/hello-world.ts"
    },
    {
      "from": "files/skill/SKILL.md",
      "ownership": "managed",
      "target": "root",
      "to": ".claude/skills/trigger-dev/SKILL.md"
    }
  ],
  "migrations": [],
  "name": "trigger-dev",
  "ops": [
    {
      "content": "\n## trigger-dev\n\nTrigger.dev runs background jobs on the jobs Target.\n\nCommands:\n\n- `bun run jobs:dev`: connect a local worker.\n- `bun run jobs:deploy`: deploy the tasks.\n\nKey files:\n\n- `trigger.config.ts`: the project config; set `TRIGGER_PROJECT_REF` in `.env`.\n- `src/trigger/hello-world.ts`: a sample task, yours to edit.\n\nSet `TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY` in `.env`; aokit never generates secrets.\n\nSkills:\n\n- `.claude/skills/trigger-dev/SKILL.md`: how to add and run tasks.\n",
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "op": "appendRegion",
      "region": "agents",
      "target": "root"
    },
    {
      "file": "package.json",
      "op": "mergeJson",
      "target": "root",
      "value": {
        "scripts": {
          "jobs:deploy": "bun run --cwd {{target:jobs}} trigger deploy",
          "jobs:dev": "bun run --cwd {{target:jobs}} trigger dev"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "override": [],
  "provides": [
    {
      "capability": "jobs",
      "cardinality": {
        "max": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "requires": [],
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "version": "1.0.0"
}
